note OVITO 3.17.2 reads extended XYZ periodicity and an out-of-cell second frame without wrapping or repeating frame 0.
note mdcompress 1.0.0 is not on PyPI. A source build of refresh-bio/mdcompress failed to compile libxdrfile on this compiler, so the coordinate-only row is omitted.
